# Findings the image scan (CI "Docker image" job and the release) is told to ignore.
# The scan already skips vulnerabilities that have no fix yet; list here only a fixable
# CRITICAL/HIGH finding that does not apply to us. One ID per line, and above it the reason,
# the date and who accepted it. Remove the entry once a fixed version is in the image.
# How to add one: docs/releasing/image-scan.md.
#
# Example (not active):
#   # CVE-2099-0001: only exploitable with the X feature, which ExactDocs never enables.
#   # Accepted 2026-11-04 by @owner, revisit when the base image moves.
#   CVE-2099-0001
